// dyn-u64(0) - dyn-u64(0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF) = 2^256 - 2^64 + 1
// 0 < 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF, so borrow = 1: limb0 = wrapping_sub(0, 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF)
// = 1, and the upper 192 bits sign-fill to all-ones.
// Word = FFFF..FFFF (48 hex F) followed by 0000000000000001.
// Push b = 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF first, then a = 0; SUB computes a - b.
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
AND
PUSH1 0x00
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
AND
SUB
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
